   {
    "kind": "text",
    "tag": "p",
    "html": "<span class=\"color_37 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">National DNA Day is a United States holiday celebrated on April 25 commemorating both Watson and Crick’s discovery of DNA and the completion of the Human Genome Project. 2023’s celebration was especially significant: the 70-year anniversary of DNA discovery, the 20-year anniversary of the completion of genome mapping, and the 20th anniversary of 23andMe as a company.</span></span>",
    "text": "National DNA Day is a United States holiday celebrated on April 25 commemorating both Watson and Crick’s discovery of DNA and the completion of the Human Genome Project. 2023’s celebration was especially significant: the 70-year anniversary of DNA discovery, the 20-year anniversary of the completion of genome mapping, and the 20th anniversary of 23andMe as a company.",
