   {
    "kind": "text",
    "tag": "p",
    "html": "<span class=\"color_37 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">To celebrate, we created a large-scale experiential event in the heart of Times Square with activities, panels, artists, musicians, and giveaways. Digital OOH ran on adjacent billboards throughout the day, and geotargeted wildpostings blanketed the surrounding streets, serving to generate interest and capture foot traffic in and out of one of New York’s busiest areas.&nbsp;</span></span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n&nbsp;",
